flowchart TB
    U["User or trusted policy<br/>Goals, priority and action authority"]
    S["Product Scout<br/>Discover problems and assess outcomes"]
    E["Engineer<br/>One continuous implementation loop"]
    V["Verifier<br/>Independent acceptance"]
    O["Operator<br/>Authorized delivery and operational observation"]
    W["Temporary subagents<br/>Optional, bounded and isolated"]
    P["PR_READY<br/>Default engineering endpoint"]
    R["Observed feedback and incidents"]
    C["Controller - ordinary code, not another Bot<br/>Routing, versions, deduplication, budgets and recovery"]
    G["CI, protected branches and scoped action executors<br/>External enforcement"]

    S -->|"Proposal, not authorization"| U
    U -->|"Accepted scope or direct task"| E
    E -->|"Pinned change and evidence"| V
    V -->|"CHANGES_REQUIRED within budget"| E
    V -->|"PASS for current snapshot"| P
    P -->|"Delivery requested"| O
    P -->|"No delivery requested"| U
    E -.->|"Optional independent subtask"| W
    W -.->|"Evidence for Engineer to integrate"| E
    U -->|"Action-specific grants"| O
    O -->|"Observed version and effects"| R
    R -->|"Product feedback"| S
    R -->|"Incident intake"| O
    O -->|"Bounded source repair"| E
    O -->|"Completion, approval need or escalation"| U

    C -.-> E
    C -.-> V
    C -.-> O
    C -.-> S
    G -.->|"Required checks"| V
    G -.->|"Authorization and deployment controls"| O
